The .445 A1 amortized in-context-exploration prior reran after the frame-grid fix (the exp4701
silent-bug reopen). This time a GENUINE test: archive ALIVE (obs=2/cells=2/prefixes=1, not the
dead 0/0/0) + prior_changed_proposals=True. Verdict no_first_win_lift_l1_wall_survives: first_win
